  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "怎么有这么多整合运动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "诶呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "只有我一个人觉得敌人越来越多了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "不是错觉。很明显，整合运动的增援到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可恶，我们甚至还没向他们报一箭之仇——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "结果，倒是他们先找上罗德岛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "芙兰卡，看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "东边的出口，藏匿着的可能是整合运动的术师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "正面的通道，两侧的高层建筑里，也有大量的整合运动暴徒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "......想要装出没发现我们的样子摸过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "这可是在......楼顶啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "无论来多少敌人，被打下去的话就会立刻完蛋了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "感觉我这聪明头脑被人小看了呢，整合运动居然选这里和我们作战......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合运动，是要发动总攻了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "全体干员，重整队形！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "等等，我好像——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "看到了整合运动之前那个指挥官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你们，把她交给龙门了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（芙兰卡，必须先震慑整合运动的敌人！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（趁他们不敢继续进攻的时候，向低层转移！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（现在必须要扩大战场！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "（知道了，那就边跑边打吧！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "与你有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我的同胞，动手吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
